{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"杠消解"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"杠消解"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p><strong>杠消解</strong> (bar resolution) 指的是"},{"Local":{"url":"杠构造","text":"杠构造"}},{"Plain":"所得的"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯对象","text":"单纯对象"}},{"Plain":"或链复形 ("},{"Local":{"url":"Dold–Kan对应","text":"Dold–Kan 对应"}},{"Plain":").</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>群的逆环路空间</h3>\n<p>todo</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The free abelian group on the nerve (of $BG$) is a simplicial abelian group; applying the Dold-Kan correspondence to it produces the bar resolution.</p>\n<p>Qiaochu Yuan, <span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://math.stackexchange.com/q/3842817\" title=\"MSE 问题下的评论 [https://math.stackexchange.com/q/3842817]\">MSE 问题下的评论</a></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>设 $G$ 为群. 所谓杠消解 (bar resolution) 是指 $\\mathbb{Z}$ 作为 $\\mathbb{Z}[G]$-模的一个自由"},{"Local":{"url":"消解","text":"消解"}},{"Plain":". 它可用于计算"},{"Local":{"url":"导出函子","text":"导出函子"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Ext}^\\bullet_{\\mathbb{Z}[G]}(\\mathbb{Z},-)$, 也即"},{"Local":{"url":"群上同调","text":"群上同调"}},{"Plain":" $H^\\bullet(G,-)$.</p>\n<h3>结合代数</h3>\n<p>设 $A,B$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"幺半范畴","text":"幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数","text":"结合代数"}},{"Plain":", 有同态 $f\\colon B\\to A$, 那么 $A$ 为 $B$-双模中的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数","text":"结合代数"}},{"Plain":",\n$$\r\nA\\otimes_B A \\rightrightarrows A\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}